## 4. OTA AI Model Hub

The app should not bundle the massive STT/TTS models in the APK. Instead, fetch the manifest and download models on demand.

**`GET /api/v1/models`**
*   **Response:**
    ```json
    {
      "models": [
        {
          "id": "whisper-cpp-tiny-int8",
          "downloadUrl": "https://cdn.itantra.org/models/whisper.bin",
          "sha256": "expected-hash-for-validation"
        }
      ]
    }
    ```

